  id: journal.moon_gravity
  title: "One-Sixth"
  author: "Suit Tech M. Varga"
  dateLine: "Field note, Moon base zone"
  category: 5
  body: "Lunar gravity is about a sixth of what you're used to, so you'll jump higher and float down slower than you expect. Watch your footing near crater rims and the edges of your own pits."
